This is the sandbox of Marc Vacher, currently a Ph.D student at LadHyX & PMMH. I work on a hydrodynamic instability of a jet/bubble plume impinging on a free-surface. Here are some Basilisk simulations on this subject, and more ! You can also learn things here : [Website](https://sites.google.com/view/marc-vacher/)

## Free Jets

* [Schlichting 2D Jet](schlichting.c)
* [Unstable 2D Jet](unstable_2D_jet.c)

## Confined Jets

* [Jet in an open channel](box_jet_long.c)
* [Jet confined in a box](box_jet.c)
* [Impinging planar jets](imp_jets.c)

* [Stable jet under a free-surface](slosh_reg_stable.c)
* [Self-induced sloshing by a jet](slosh_reg.c)

## Sloshing

* [Sloshing as a damped oscillator](slosh_dissipation.c)
* [Sloshing with wall dissipation](slosh_dissipation_wall.c)
